  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital competencies for teachers in Member States of G77+China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In collaboration with the Member States of the G77 and China, UNESCO is implementing the &#x201c;Digital Competencies for Teachers in Member States of G77 + China&#x201d; project, aimed at harnessing the opportunities offered by digital technologies and AI for education. The primary goal is to foster policy dialogue and peer learning, and the intended impact is to enhance the skills of teachers in order to prepare them for the digital transformation of education.</narrative>
